## 23. Find Minimum in Rotated Sorted Array — LeetCode #153

**Pattern:** Binary Search

```java
class Solution {
    public int findMin(int[] nums) {

        int left = 0;
        int right = nums.length - 1;

        while (left < right) {

            int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;

            if (nums[mid] > nums[right]) {
                left = mid + 1;
            } 
            else {
                right = mid;
            }
        }

        return nums[left];
    }
}
```

**Example:**

```text
Input:
[4,5,6,7,0,1,2]

Output:
0
```

### Logic

If:

```text
nums[mid] > nums[right]
```

minimum **must be on the right**.

So:

```text
left = mid + 1
```

Otherwise:

```text
right = mid
```

**Time:** `O(log n)`
**Space:** `O(1)`

